Package: libsitu-dev
Version: @VERSION@
Section: libdevel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Homepage: https://github.com/funklord/situ
Description: C runtime for code generated by situc
 The header and static library that code generated by situc includes and links
 against: bounded reads and writes, byte-order helpers, and the view and
 message types the generated accessors are written in terms of.
 .
 It allocates nothing, recurses nowhere and uses no variable-length arrays, so
 it is usable from a freestanding or embedded build.
 .
 A static library only: there is no ABI to keep stable yet, and a shared
 object would be a promise this project is not ready to make.
